        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 4 x 16 Pull Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size 4\" x 16\" commercial door pull plate with 8-3/8\" pull handle. Primarily used in restaurants, warehouses, factories and stores. Made in the USA from .050\" thick solid brass or solid bronze.  Packaged with mounting hardware for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-7131-605_size.gif?v=1704354634\" width=\"580\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 7131-605 Pull Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-4-x-16-pull-plate-don-jo-7131-630\"><b>Stainless Steel Pull Plate</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/economy-priced-aluminum-4-x-16-pull-plates-don-jo-7131-628\"><b>Brushed Aluminum 4\" x 16\" Pull Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of 2 different materials in 2 finish choices:<br>\r\n*Don-Jo 7131-605 Solid Brass: Polished Brass finish.<br>\r\n*Don-Jo 7131-613 Solid Bronze: Oil Rubbed Bronze finish.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo Commercial Pull Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Height: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Solid Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  Optional <b>Polished Brass</b> or <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7131-605.pdf?v=1704262268\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 7131-605 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7131-613.pdf?v=1704262269\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 7131-613 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b> Get a matching <a href=\"/products/4-x-16-push-plate-don-jo-71-xxx\"><b>4\" x 16\" Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>",
